6. She struggles with procrastination, especially when unwell. (Verbatim: "I was gonna procrastinate this so hard because I'm gonna be trying my best to recover")
7. She is late on a voice pack deadline for a Halloween release. (Verbatim: "I was still 12 hours late of that deadline that I was given")
8. She feels guilty about missing deadlines and sends apologies to her collaborators. (Verbatim: "I'm so sorry I'm so sorry please forgive me please forgive me please forgive me please forgive me")
