10. She values human decency and equality regardless of physical appearance. (Verbatim: "my rules for for human decency is just equal no matter how someone looks like i'm not going to excuse someone because they look nice or look like to other people") [end of text]



1. She enjoys playing cute characters in video games and has no shame in her preference. (Verbatim: "i just you know what it's just what i like if i liked cooler things i'd be doing that i'm just doing what i like")
