5. She experienced emotional conflict due to being raised with extrinsic motivation rather than intrinsic drive. (Verbatim: "they're like no screw your intrinsic motivations extrinsic motivation only you must only succeed to to to to to feel better than than who we're comparing you to")
6. She has a history of being highly competitive, but has learned to redirect that competitiveness toward self-improvement. (Verbatim: "i've learned i've learned to be competitive just with myself or yeah like because")
7. She previously worked as a full-time software developer before transitioning to becoming a VTuber. (Verbatim: "i was going through such a existential crisis then i was going through so much of of just like thoughts like yeah yeah yeah yeah i have holes there are wholesome moments um yeah i mean it was straight after the yo what's what's my do i get a present like all the other students are getting presents from their parents for completing their degrees do i get one and they were like you have your brain you wouldn't have that brain if it wasn't for us that brain is is is our gift to you")
8. She has a vivid dream in which she streamed live while asleep, with the stream running for two hours on the "starting soon" screen. (Verbatim: "i had it on the starting soon screen and i fell asleep yeah i fell asleep in my own dream okay i fell asleep in my own dream okay and then i woke up and i saw that the stream had been going on for like two hours or some two hours something of like just the starting soon screen")
9. She has a dog that she looks after in her flat. (Verbatim: "i'm looking after and just like chatting to myself like a dum-dum i think i got really like delirious at one point okay oh my god wait did i tell you i don't think i told you guys this okay so there was one point where i was like asleep and and i was like on the sofa and i had the most vivid dream of streaming okay")
10. She has a strong emotional memory of her father expressing pride in her during her graduation, which helped her during a later existential crisis. (Verbatim: "papa elia saying to me like like congratulating me gave me a hug and said that you know proud of me and to also like also knows that like um because because i think i think he knew that i just mostly did all this sciencey stuff um one because i was good at it and two because it was what they wanted") [end of text]



